## Common mistakes to watch for

- Unquoted variables: filenames with spaces will break the loop
- Spaces around `=` when creating a variable
- Calling a function before it is defined
- Forgetting `local` inside functions
- Using `$1` inside a function and expecting the script's argument
- Forgetting `-r` on `cp` when copying directories

